  "sn27.5:1.2": "Yo bhikkhave cakkhusamphassajāya vedanāya chandarāgo citasseso upakkileso || || 4-8 ",
  "sn27.5:1.3": "Yo sotasamphassajāya vedanāya || || ",
  "sn27.5:1.4": "Yo ghānasamphassajāya vedanāya || ",
  "sn27.5:1.5": "Yo jivhāsamphassajāya vedanāya || ",
  "sn27.5:1.6": "Yo kāyasamphassajāya vedanāya || ",
  "sn27.5:1.7": "Yo manasamphassajāya vedanāya chandarāgo cittasseso upakkileso || || 9 ",
  "sn27.5:1.8": "Yato kho bhikkhave bhikkhuno || pe || ",
  "sn27.5:1.9": "abhiññāsacchikaraṇīyesu dhammesūti || || 1-3 ",
  "sn27.5:1.10": "Sāvatthi || || "
